              </h3>
              <p className="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
                <strong className="text-purple-700 dark:text-purple-400">Web Workers</strong> allow you to run JavaScript in separate threads, preventing heavy computations from blocking the main UI thread. Perfect for data processing, calculations, and intensive tasks!
